      "writtenOn": "2025-11-11T19:27:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This seems like it may not be necessary. If the adapter limit is 0 then the device limit should also automatically be 0? Not quite sure if that\u0027s what happens though.",
      "revId": "5d26acb97f7b206fb97068aad97f40ad4909e216",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
