        "id": 1000014
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-11-11T19:57:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right, devices get the defaults. But if the adapter has 0 then the default should be 0? Maybe if 0 is an allowed tier then this will work?\n\nOr would it require reverting too much of the original change to allow 0 to be the default? If so then this hack is fine.",
      "parentUuid": "db237aa0_a4e2717b",
      "revId": "5d26acb97f7b206fb97068aad97f40ad4909e216",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
